# Commercial assets

## Folders
- Root: design & print
- Music Photography (Commercial)/ — tag: music-photography
- Photography Commercial/ — tag: photography (+ Costume/ → costume)
- thumbs/ — optimized WebP thumbnails (auto-generated)

## Adding photos
1. Drop files in the right folder
2. Add the filename to src/data/commercialManifests.ts
3. Run: npm run thumbs:commercial
4. New filter types: commercialTags.ts + tags[] on works
